# X47 baseline UFW IPv4 rules
# Reference machine had UFW enabled/active, openssh-server NOT installed.
# Default: deny incoming, allow outgoing. Re-snapshot with sudo to replace
# with exact live rules if they differ.
#
# Rules that require privilege to read (/etc/ufw/user.rules) were not
# readable without an interactive sudo password during packaging.

*filter
:ufw-user-input - [0:0]
:ufw-user-output - [0:0]
:ufw-user-forward - [0:0]
:ufw-user-limit - [0:0]
:ufw-user-limit-accept - [0:0]
### RULES ###

### END RULES ###

# don't delete the 'COMMIT' line or these rules won't be processed
COMMIT
